Subject: [PATCH 15/15] lakeside r4: night lake reflects its own dark blue-teal
 sky; tests lock sky reflection > 0

r3 reused the day dusk beige/orange low/horizon at night (x0.12) -> orange-brown lake centre.
lakesideModeLighting now also carries the reflected sky, tint and mix floor per mode and
applyLakesideWaterMode writes them (board and journey copies alike). Night: zenith = #1c2740
linear 0.011/0.02/0.051, low 0.014/0.045/0.065, horizon 0.018/0.06/0.068, skyStrength 0.6,
floor 0.28, tint 0.7/0.95/1, amb 1.0. lakeside-shared-water checks the per-mode part on both
copies; new lakeside-sky-reflection locks strength/floor/Fresnel > 0, night B>=G>R, day not warm.
